# Every text file is LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Windows (core.autocrlf=true) otherwise checks out CRLF, and `sos` embeds the kit files at build
# time: a Windows build shipped `#!/usr/bin/env bash\r` hooks and recorded CRLF hashes
# (POD-agent, 23/10/2026). Per-extension globs missed the extensionless scripts (scripts/advise,
# scripts/bite, templates/app/hooks/*) twice, so this is global.
* text=auto eol=lf
